    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/0809.2981v2</id>
    <title>Presenting the cohomology of a Schubert variety</title>
    <updated>2009-09-04T21:19:20Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/0809.2981v2" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/0809.2981v2" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>  We extend the short presentation due to [Borel '53] of the cohomology ring of a generalized flag manifold to a relatively short presentation of the cohomology of any of its Schubert varieties. Our result is stated in a root-system uniform manner by introducing the essential set of a Coxeter group element, generalizing and giving a new characterization of [Fulton '92]'s definition for permutations. Further refinements are obtained in type A.</summary>
